OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny heavy,
OL,6,Fthundery, showers easing this evening,
OL,7,Ffollowed by variable cloud and clear
OL,8,Fspells into the night. Staying warm
OL,9,Fmuggy overnight, with mist and hill
OL,10,Ffog developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry at first with sunny
OL,13,Fspells. Turning cloudier from the
OL,14,Fsouth with heavy, thundery rain
OL,15,Fpushing northwards through late
OL,16,Fafternoon and during the evening.
OL,17,FFrequent lightning and large hail
OL,18,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
