OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Fmixed through Friday and the weekend,
OL,7,Fwith further rain and showers, heavy
OL,8,Fand perhaps thundery at times. Some
OL,9,Fdrier and brighter spells also
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Temperatures nearer
OL,11,Faverage.
